WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:07.080
Jai Shri Mataji.
Jai Shri Mataji.

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:11.960
Today evening at the Sai Yoga Ashram
in Talnu, Dharamsala,

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:16.720
we have a very senior Sai Yogini with us,
Mrs. Jai Lakshmi.

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:18.920
Jai Shri Mataji. Jai Shri Mataji.

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:23.520
So, Aunty is originally from Kerala,
but living in Bangalore

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:27.320
for a very long time now.
She worked with ISRO,

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:33.640
and she retired in 2013
as the financial advisor of ISRO.

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:37.160
And we are honored
to have you with us, Aunty.

00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:37.880
Thank you, Isma.

00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:42.440
And we would like to know more about you
and how you came into Sai Yoga,

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.560
if you could share with us, Aunty.

00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:49.840
See, basically,
I am an ardent devotee of Devi.

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:55.480
I used to chant Lalita Sahasrama
by heart, then Soundari Lagari.

00:00:56.760 --> 00:00:59.760
And our family
is also a spiritual family.

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:03.440
My father, mother,
everybody used to worship Devi only.

00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:05.200
Devi Bhaktas. Devi Bhaktas.

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:09.800
So, the Purana, Devi Bhagavadam,
Devi Mahatmyam—

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:12.840
my father used to explain it.
It was in Sanskrit, you know.

00:01:13.480 --> 00:01:15.800
So, he used to read
and they explained to us.

00:01:16.520 --> 00:01:22.480
So, from that day onwards,
I was having a desire to meet Devi.

00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:25.960
Then, my father used to tell,
"You cannot meet Devi.

00:01:27.080 --> 00:01:30.800
You can only feel Devi,"
my father used to tell.

00:01:31.720 --> 00:01:36.560
But I was not feeling.
Searching—that search was on.

00:01:36.560 --> 00:01:42.880
Always, I was searching for that.
Then, I didn't get it.

00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:45.840
This puja, everything was—
rituals was going on.

00:01:47.280 --> 00:01:50.840
Suddenly, I had developed
a problem in the Agya.

00:01:51.800 --> 00:01:57.400
There is a projection in the Agya.
So many doctors could not treat;

00:01:57.400 --> 00:02:05.160
MRI we have taken. No medicines;
they could not find out what it is.

00:02:06.320 --> 00:02:09.160
Then, one day,
I sat before Devi's photo:

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:17.680
"What is this? You are not curing me,
and I am worshipping you.

00:02:18.840 --> 00:02:23.720
What is this? So, I want to know.
Am I doing anything wrong?

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:28.720
You can teach me; I will correct myself.
You are not talking also.

00:02:28.720 --> 00:02:32.240
You are sitting in the photograph.
If this goes on..."

00:02:32.240 --> 00:02:37.840
Everybody told me to stop the puja,
whatever I am doing, because,

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:41.240
"Too early for you,
too much you are involved in that puja.

00:02:41.240 --> 00:02:47.360
Stop the puja." I stopped,
but I am not able to maintain that.

00:02:47.920 --> 00:02:50.880
Without chanting Devi,
without doing the puja,

00:02:50.880 --> 00:02:54.440
I am not able to be normal.
It was going on.

00:02:54.440 --> 00:03:00.560
Then, one day, before the photograph,
one Saturday, my children went to school.

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:05.480
Then, my husband went to office.
I sat before the photograph

00:03:05.480 --> 00:03:11.400
and I told her, "Within one week,
if you solve this problem—

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:14.320
don't solve this problem,
I am going to commit suicide."

00:03:14.320 --> 00:03:15.400
Oh my gosh.

00:03:16.280 --> 00:03:20.680
"Because this, all are asking,
what is this? Continues.

00:03:20.680 --> 00:03:23.720
More than 8–9 months over now.
It's not going.

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:29.080
Then, I will write a suicide note:
You are responsible for that.

00:03:30.680 --> 00:03:34.000
Let this world know you are bad—
bad mother."

00:03:35.680 --> 00:03:42.680
That much I was angry with Devi.
"And not only that, you have to do,

00:03:42.680 --> 00:03:45.120
within one week's time,
you have to come

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:51.640
and knock my door as Guru.
I don't know who is good Guru.

00:03:51.640 --> 00:03:53.840
I don't want anybody other than you."

00:03:53.840 --> 00:03:55.640
Yeah, wow.
The seeking was always there.

00:03:56.800 --> 00:04:00.720
"You have to come as Guru,
knock my door.

00:04:00.720 --> 00:04:05.840
You have to tell me, 'I am your Guru.'
All these things should happen

00:04:05.840 --> 00:04:10.640
by next week.
Then, I am going to commit suicide."

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:17.280
Then, I cried that day so much.
Then, I got up, as usual.

00:04:17.800 --> 00:04:20.080
Next day onwards,
I started going to office.

00:04:20.800 --> 00:04:26.600
Friday evening, I am coming from office.
From my staircase, I am getting down.

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:31.520
I saw in the notice board, paper cutting:
Kamala Devi is coming on Saturday.

00:04:31.520 --> 00:04:35.400
There is a program,
Kundalini Awakening.

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:41.760
There is a program, it's going to happen.
I thought, whether it is true or not,

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:45.360
I don't know.
I don't want to believe it also. Okay.

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:50.320
Again, I came down. Again, I went up.
I took that paper piece,

00:04:50.320 --> 00:04:52.720
went home, and read.
I asked my husband.

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:57.880
I said, "Okay, you go and come.
No problem," he told.

00:04:57.880 --> 00:05:03.280
Otherwise,
he is not a normal person—he agreed.

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:08.400
Then, I asked my next neighbor.
She is also a spiritual lady,

00:05:08.400 --> 00:05:11.280
Bama, her name:
"Can you come with me?

00:05:11.280 --> 00:05:14.800
We will go for the program."
She told, "Okay, we will go."

00:05:15.840 --> 00:05:20.120
Then, program, as per the paper,
it was to start by 4:30 evening.

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:25.720
So, we thought, 4:30 means 6:30;
by 8, we can come back home.

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:31.120
It is little far off place.
But still, I cooked everything,

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:35.240
kept it on the table,
and went for the program.

00:05:35.240 --> 00:05:40.280
I told him, "If I am late, you can eat
and give it to children also."

00:05:40.280 --> 00:05:42.720
But that lady,
she did not cook and come,

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:47.960
because in their house,
9 o'clock, 10 o'clock only they will eat.

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:53.400
"So, I will go and cook and give them."
She is telling me,

00:05:53.400 --> 00:05:58.440
"Come, we will go back."
He is not allowing me to sit.

00:05:58.440 --> 00:06:02.360
Front line, front, we went early.
We were sitting in the front line.

00:06:03.560 --> 00:06:06.400
She told, "No."
I told, "No, I am not coming."

00:06:07.320 --> 00:06:10.200
"Then, what do you want?
You want to see her only, no?"

00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:13.520
I tell, "Yeah, I want only see her."

00:06:15.280 --> 00:06:17.960
"Then, after seeing her,
you come with me, no?"

00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:20.160
"Yeah, I will come.
Only I want to see her."

00:06:20.800 --> 00:06:25.360
So, she was keeping quiet for some time.
Then, one thing she told,

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:29.000
"Okay, front, we will not sit.
There is an exit door.

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:34.560
Mother will come that way.
This is an exit door is there.

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:37.640
We will go and stand
next to that exit door.

00:06:38.400 --> 00:06:43.200
You want to see her?
See, we will go back." I agreed.

00:06:43.200 --> 00:06:45.880
Okay, then we were standing
on the back door.

00:06:47.880 --> 00:06:53.200
So, car came, Mother came.
I got a fragrance, divine fragrance.

00:06:54.120 --> 00:06:58.120
The tons of agarbatti, if you like,
how that fragrance comes.

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:02.240
I asked her,
"Mama, you are getting fragrance?"

00:07:02.960 --> 00:07:07.960
"No, you are really mad, Jayalashmi.
Nothing is coming here, nothing.

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:10.680
I am not getting anything.
How is that you are getting?"

00:07:12.400 --> 00:07:15.680
"No, I am getting. It is increasing,
increasing, increasing."

00:07:16.800 --> 00:07:21.680
Then, Mother came with that door,
white sari, red border.

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:27.400
Looking at her, I was so happy.
Then, she came and sat.

00:07:28.360 --> 00:07:31.240
She told, "Do like that.
Everybody sit like that."

00:07:31.240 --> 00:07:36.360
But we were standing.
Then, she, Mother sat.

00:07:37.080 --> 00:07:40.200
Till then,
I was seeing her in the white sari.

00:07:40.200 --> 00:07:46.880
Once she sat, that Devi Saruba,
Mother's face—face is Mother.

00:07:47.520 --> 00:07:50.200
I started crying.
I wanted to meet her, no?

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:55.760
I started crying.
There is one slogan, my favorite slogan.

00:07:55.760 --> 00:07:57.080
I started crying.&nbsp;

00:08:34.880 --> 00:08:37.240
This I sang in the auditorium.

00:08:37.960 --> 00:08:42.760
All are looking at me. This Bama,
"I thought half mad, you are full mad."

00:08:42.760 --> 00:08:47.360
No. Then, she is—I was not—
she is telling something.

00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:52.440
I was crying, crying, crying.
Full Kundalini came up.

00:08:52.440 --> 00:08:55.920
I am seeing all the chakras,
all the, this one.

00:08:55.920 --> 00:08:59.920
Here, Nirmala, it is written.
It went up to here.

00:09:00.880 --> 00:09:04.120
I am not able to open the—
I was in ecstasy.

00:09:04.120 --> 00:09:08.480
I don't know what to do.
Heart opened, filled with love.

00:09:09.560 --> 00:09:13.400
I want to put it in cup and give it
to all the people who are standing there.

00:09:14.960 --> 00:09:18.200
Fill the cup, fill the cup.
She is calling,

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:21.480
"Come, you wanted to see, come."
I said, "I will not come, you go."

00:09:25.760 --> 00:09:28.840
Then, I opened my eyes.
Then, I saw Shri Mataji.

00:09:28.840 --> 00:09:33.200
Then, she started talking.
I just merged with her.

00:09:35.120 --> 00:09:40.000
I just—she is talking, talking.
What she is talking is not going.

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:44.240
I am that enjoying joy,
bubbling, bubbling, bubbling joy.

00:09:44.240 --> 00:09:50.160
Then, I said, this is the end.
I was completely detached from the body.

00:09:51.000 --> 00:09:57.600
Complete detachment I felt.
That's what I wanted: to meet God.

00:09:58.360 --> 00:10:01.800
Then, I remembered my father.
My father used to tell, "You feel God."

00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:04.840
I felt and also I met God.

00:10:04.840 --> 00:10:06.920
Wow, that is wonderful.

00:10:06.920 --> 00:10:11.200
Enough. That this is the end.
Nothing is required for me.

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:15.600
Then, it was late. Somehow, we went.
That is another miracle

00:10:15.600 --> 00:10:20.400
also happened on the way.
It's a little, big one.

00:10:21.400 --> 00:10:27.840
Then, we came. It was very late.
So, after coming home only, I thought,

00:10:27.840 --> 00:10:30.480
"Oh, my husband is going to shout at me.
Definitely."

00:10:32.600 --> 00:10:37.200
But, then I told,
"Shri Mataji, he should not shout.

00:10:37.200 --> 00:10:42.640
You take care," I told.
He is very quietly standing.

00:10:43.400 --> 00:10:46.560
I was thinking
whether it's my house or not,

00:10:46.560 --> 00:10:51.440
whether he is my husband or not.
He is telling, not, "Oh, why so late?"

00:10:52.280 --> 00:10:54.680
He is asking, whether he is
the same person I am seeing!

00:10:56.240 --> 00:10:59.760
Then, we went inside like that.
It happened.

00:11:00.600 --> 00:11:02.800
Then, I challenged,
"No, you have to come

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:07.800
and knock the door also," I told, no?
Next day was Ekadashi.

00:11:08.680 --> 00:11:15.600
I used to fast those days. Not full fast.
Only afternoon, I will take one banana,

00:11:15.600 --> 00:11:22.400
one glass of milk. Nothing else I take.
I took that and we were all

00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:27.360
sitting in the hall.
The same fragrance comes,

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:32.240
what I felt in the auditorium,
Town Hall auditorium.

00:11:33.560 --> 00:11:37.760
Then, I asked the neighbor
whether they have bought any agarbatti.

00:11:38.440 --> 00:11:45.280
The front, back, every house I checked.
They told, "No." Then, I closed the door.

00:11:46.080 --> 00:11:48.560
When I closed the door,
it is increasing.

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:51.720
Then, in the sofa,
four of us were sitting:

00:11:51.720 --> 00:11:56.560
my children, my husband.
Then, I got up and went to kitchen.

00:11:57.240 --> 00:12:00.120
Then, I asked my younger son.
He was 9, 10 years.

00:12:01.640 --> 00:12:09.040
He asked me, I went to kitchen:
"Girish, come here.

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:12.840
Whether you are getting smell here?"
"Yeah, now, when you came,

00:12:12.840 --> 00:12:17.080
it was not there," he is telling.
"Now, here in the kitchen,

00:12:17.080 --> 00:12:20.920
we are getting the same fragrance."
Then, it is a duplex house.

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:28.240
I went up, and all of them came.
Then, they told, "Oh, you are here.

00:12:28.240 --> 00:12:33.000
That fragrance is coming."
Wherever—Girish told,

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:35.960
"Mama, wherever you are going,
that smell is coming.

00:12:35.960 --> 00:12:38.520
You are not there,
that smell is not there."

00:12:38.520 --> 00:12:44.320
Then, it stuck to me. Then, I said,
"Please forgive me, Devi. I scolded you.

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:49.040
But, now, I accept you. You are my Guru.
You are everything to me.

00:12:49.960 --> 00:12:53.360
You are not only Devi.
You are my mother. You are my father.

00:12:53.360 --> 00:13:00.280
You are everything to me. I accept you.
You please accept me as your child."

00:13:00.280 --> 00:13:01.120
Lovely.

00:13:02.320 --> 00:13:08.240
This is how I got the realization.
Next day, I came home.

00:13:08.240 --> 00:13:11.600
I wind up all the photographs
which I had in the puja room.

00:13:12.440 --> 00:13:16.680
I thrown in the lake.
I myself went early morning

00:13:16.680 --> 00:13:20.280
before anybody could get up—
all the photographs.

00:13:20.800 --> 00:13:26.760
That day, I stopped all the rituals
what I was following till then,

00:13:26.760 --> 00:13:30.800
because I am a Kerala Orthodox
family Brahmin, Kerala Brahmin.

00:13:32.440 --> 00:13:37.040
So, everything from that day onwards,
whenever Shri Madaji announces puja,

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:41.400
that is the function for me.
That day only, festival in our house.

00:13:43.040 --> 00:13:45.840
Everybody used to tell me,
"The tradition—

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:50.400
you are not teaching your children."
The tradition is starting now only!

00:13:51.040 --> 00:13:54.680
When they grow, they will learn this.
Let them learn only this,

00:13:55.760 --> 00:14:00.280
not the old things.
This is the new dimension.

00:14:02.040 --> 00:14:05.840
God Himself has come,
then what do you want?

00:14:06.880 --> 00:14:09.680
So, only what she says only,
we have to follow.

00:14:11.240 --> 00:14:13.640
Whenever she declares,
that is the festival.

00:14:13.640 --> 00:14:17.000
That day only, we celebrate.
That day only,

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:20.880
whether it is Sunday morning, I will do;
evening only, puja means like that.

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:25.840
That's all. From that day till today,
in our house, it is like that only.

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:30.040
And we are gathered here today to,
you know, do the Navratri puja,

00:14:30.040 --> 00:14:33.840
offer puja to Shri Madaji
as Shaila Putri in the Himalayas.

00:14:33.840 --> 00:14:35.200
Yes, Sahistrar of the world.

00:14:35.200 --> 00:14:40.000
Yeah. And since it is Navratri time,
I will request Uncle Yogi to, you know,

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:43.000
tell us the significance of Navratri.

00:14:43.720 --> 00:14:46.120
If Uncle, you could please
share with us that.

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:52.280
Thank you. It was very inspiring
to listen to your experience.

00:14:52.280 --> 00:14:58.520
And thank you very much for coming
for the nine nights of worship

00:14:58.520 --> 00:15:04.000
of the Goddess at Sage Yoga Ashram,
Talnu, Dharamsala.

00:15:05.080 --> 00:15:11.200
So, now let's talk a little bit
about the different aspects

00:15:12.480 --> 00:15:19.560
of the Goddess. Each day,
we worship a different aspect of her.

00:15:20.160 --> 00:15:27.200
For instance, on the first day,
we worship her as Shri Shaila Putri.

00:15:27.840 --> 00:15:34.600
That is, the daughter of the Himalayas.
She did a lot of penance

00:15:35.800 --> 00:15:41.320
to marry Lord Shiva. Therefore,
she represents the Shakti

00:15:42.480 --> 00:15:48.840
who nurtures and comforts the whole world
like a divine caring mother.

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:55.040
The second day,
we worship her as Brahmacharani.

00:15:55.960 --> 00:15:59.040
So, her tapasya,
the penance she performed,

00:15:59.760 --> 00:16:05.600
was the inspiration
to discipline ourselves

00:16:05.600 --> 00:16:12.720
and break through the bondage
of the elements that give us comfort

00:16:12.720 --> 00:16:16.560
and seek the comfort of our spirit.

00:16:17.520 --> 00:16:23.880
Then, on the third day,
we worship her as Shri Chandraghanta.

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:32.560
She has the moon-like quality
of soothing us, our anxieties,

00:16:33.400 --> 00:16:36.760
and also energizes our spirit.

00:16:38.320 --> 00:16:43.640
Then, on the fourth day,
we worship her as Kushmanda.

00:16:44.560 --> 00:16:48.760
She is the Prakriti
that creates the universe.

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:57.320
So, we say to her that,
"Shri Mataji, you do everything.

00:16:57.320 --> 00:17:04.720
We do nothing at all. Please guide us
to rise above the doership in us."

00:17:05.440 --> 00:17:11.080
Then, on the fifth day,
we worship her as Skandmata,

00:17:11.080 --> 00:17:16.920
the mother of Kartikeya—
the mother who keeps us always

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:22.560
in her loving bandhan and protects us.

00:17:23.560 --> 00:17:27.680
Then, on the sixth day,
she is worshipped as Shri Katiyaini.

00:17:28.600 --> 00:17:34.160
She is compassionate and yet
can be very angry at the demons.

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:43.440
In the present world scenario,
all our collective chakras,

00:17:43.440 --> 00:17:50.320
our collective channels are disturbed
by the chaos in the world.

00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:55.280
While we are able to balance
our individual chakras,

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:59.160
it is hard to balance
the collective chakras,

00:17:59.920 --> 00:18:09.120
because the demons are interfering
and bringing chaos in the world.

00:18:09.680 --> 00:18:14.640
So, to bring peace,
we have to fight the demons.

00:18:15.160 --> 00:18:18.280
But actually, it is not we
who have to fight the demons;

00:18:18.280 --> 00:18:22.920
it is the Goddess who fights the demons.
So, we have to pray to the Goddess

00:18:23.840 --> 00:18:27.120
to destroy the demons
and bring world peace.

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:32.400
Then, on the seventh day,
is the day of Kalratri,

00:18:33.040 --> 00:18:39.360
where the Goddess takes us out
from the dark night of ignorance

00:18:40.320 --> 00:18:44.400
and brings us the light
through the process of self-realization.

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:50.520
Then, on the eighth day,
we worship her as Shri Mahagauri.

00:18:51.400 --> 00:18:58.440
She places in our Muladhara Chakra
the quality of innocence.

00:18:59.600 --> 00:19:05.040
This quality is innate.
It can never be destroyed.

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:13.040
And through this innocence,
we gain wisdom that guides us

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:15.560
towards our evolution.

00:19:16.320 --> 00:19:20.600
Then, on the ninth day,
that is the last day,

00:19:21.680 --> 00:19:28.600
she helps us to cross all the chakras
and rise beyond the Sahasrara.

00:19:29.520 --> 00:19:35.760
Then, she showers all her blessings.
When the Goddess is pleased,

00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:41.800
she bestows upon us all the siddhis,
all her powers,

00:19:43.280 --> 00:19:47.720
and gives us eternal peace and joy.

00:19:48.480 --> 00:19:55.680
Let us, in this forthcoming pujas,
open our hearts

00:19:56.240 --> 00:20:00.560
and pray to the Goddess
to come in our hearts

00:20:01.280 --> 00:20:08.320
and usher us in the Kingdom of God.
Jai Shri Mataji.

